WEBVTT

00:04:58.913 --> 00:05:02.329
He had a newborn son, so his financial
responsibilities were growing.

00:05:02.871 --> 00:05:07.371
And just when you thought things couldn't
get any worse, his wife had a stroke.

00:05:07.996 --> 00:05:10.204
This is the most driven woman I know.

00:05:10.204 --> 00:05:13.538
And when you see that kind of person
sitting in a wheelchair,

00:05:13.538 --> 00:05:16.038
I just felt the weight of the
world had this little boy.

00:05:16.121 --> 00:05:19.288
You're thinking, my wife looks
to me, my son looks to me,

00:05:19.913 --> 00:05:24.204
what am I going to do? I just finally
I went to another room and

00:05:24.204 --> 00:05:27.496
I just closed door and I just kind
of had a little pity party.

00:05:28.038 --> 00:05:29.163
What is a pity party?

00:05:29.413 --> 00:05:32.663
Well, I didn't want to say I cried,
but that's what I did.